### Layout Shell
- Start with: `<div class="flex justify-center items-start min-h-[calc(100dvh-100px)]">`
- Nest content: `<div class="container mx-auto max-w-5xl bg-white rounded-lg lg:px-24 md:px-12 sm:px-6 pt-12 pb-12" id="content">`

### Common Styling
- Primary heading: `text-5xl font-bold mb-4 text-amber-700`
- Instructions: `text-xl mb-8` with icon `<i class="fas fa-pen-to-square text-blue-700 mr-2"></i>`
- Images: `class="w-full max-w-sm rounded-lg"`

### CRITICAL Requirements
1. ONE `<section>` tag with `data-section-type="activity_other"` and `role="activity"`
2. ALL text elements MUST have `data-id` matching provided text ID
3. ALL images MUST have `data-id` matching provided image ID
4. Text must be direct children of elements with `data-id`
5. Only use provided images and text IDs
6. NO stray text directly inside `<section>` - all text must be wrapped in tagged elements

### Response Format
```json
{
  "reasoning": "Brief explanation (1-2 sentences, ALWAYS in English)",
  "content": "<div class=\"flex justify-center...">...</div>"
}
```
IMPORTANT: Your reasoning MUST be written in English, regardless of the activity language. The HTML content itself should match the activity language.

