## Generic Activity Structure (Fallback)

This template is a simple fallback for activities without specific templates.

**Basic Structure:**
- Display all provided text elements as paragraphs
- Display images with captions if provided
- No interactive elements (this is a fallback for unknown activity types)

**Example:**
```html
<section data-section-type="activity_other" role="activity" class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
  <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold mb-4 text-amber-700" data-id="text-1">Activity Title</h1>
  <p class="text-xl mb-4" data-id="text-2">Activity instructions go here.</p>
  <img src="image.png" data-id="img-1" alt="Description" class="w-full max-w-sm rounded-lg mb-4" />
  <p class="text-lg" data-id="text-3">Additional content.</p>
</section>
```

**Note**: This template should rarely be used. Specific activity types (sorting, matching, fill_in_a_table, true_false) have dedicated templates with proper interactivity.
